<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki 4-mth sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki 4-mth sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish confectionery and food packaging group Huhtamaki Oy on Tuesday gave the following breakdown of its January-April net sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p>    NET SALES	  Jan-April '97  Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Leaf total		    986		757</p>
<p>   Europe			972		744</p>
<p>   Asia-Pacific		 14		 13</p>
<p> Polarcup total		912		842</p>
<p>   Europe			773		727</p>
<p>   Asia-Pacific		139		115</p>
<p> Discontinued operations    -		 992</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT</p>
<p> Leaf			     16		 47</p>
<p> Polarcup			 72		 65</p>
<p> Corporate			21		 -9</p>
<p> Discontinued operations     -		 53</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 6805 0240, news@reuter.fi</p>
